# PLAN 3.4 matrix: OptTarget WFE x aspheric (OptAsph h^4) DOF (CC 2026-10-11; the programmatic twins are
# tCalibMatrix / test_calib_matrix.py, TO).  The deck (tst_calib_asph.in) is spoiled: h^4 5e-3 m^-3;
# CALIB must remove the spoil, print its merit and say why it stopped.  SPOT is the deck's own
# target; WFE / ZWF are selected through SETP (SETP offers WFE, ZWF and Beam -- not SPOT).
# DEADLINE: 120
# COPY: $ROOT/ZGD_test_files/tst_calib_asph.in
old $DECK
setp
WFE
10
1e-12
1
1
no
calib
no
yes
show 1
